     <span class="callout-label">KEY CONCEPT</span>
     NEPSE is macro-exposed but not portfolio-exposed. Global events reach the index through remittances, oil-driven reserve pressure, and the NPR-INR peg's effect on domestic monetary policy — not through foreign funds buying or selling Nepali shares. The transmission is slow and indirect, but it is not weak.
